{{also|limacon}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|limacon}} (without the [[cedilla]])

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|limaçon}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|limax||snail}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} A [[plane curve]] with [[polar equation]] <math>\rho = a + b\,\sin\,\theta</math> or <math>\rho = a + b\,\cos\,\theta</math>, of which the [[cardioid]] is a special case.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|limaçon of Pascal}}

